--TEST--
the resilient parse is what a cursor request rests on, so a document whose last class never closes still documents the enum above it, `rule:ide/one-grammar-one-tree`
--FILE--
<?nvs
/// Where a request got to.
///
/// `Draft` is written but not visible; `Live` is both.
enum Status: int
{
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

var $s = Status::Li<|>ve;
echo $s;

class Half {
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
Where a request got to.

`Draft` is written but not visible; `Live` is both.
